{"site":"douban","sid":"1298366","imdb_id":"tt0054331","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0054331/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1298366/","chinese_title":"斯巴达克斯","foreign_title":"Spartacus","year":"1960","aka":["万夫莫敌(台)","斯巴达克思","风云群英会(港)"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["剧情","动作","传记","历史","冒险"],"language":["英语"],"playdate":["1960-10-07"],"episodes":"","duration":"184分钟(首映版)","description":"公元前73年，来自古罗马利比亚省的奴隶斯巴达克斯（柯克•道格拉斯 Kirk Douglas 饰）在加普亚格斗学校中爱上了女奴瓦瑞妮娅（琼•西蒙斯 Jean Simmons 饰）。同年，格斗学校的奴隶在斯巴达克斯带领下发动起义，获得自由，随后斯巴达克斯与瓦瑞妮娅团聚，结为夫妇。起义震惊了罗马的统治集团，激化了元老院中贵族派和平民派的矛盾。贵族将领克拉苏（劳伦斯•奥利维尔 Laurence Olivier 饰）乘机击败平民派首领格拉古（查尔斯•劳顿 Charles Laughton 饰），篡夺了首席执政官的权力，实行独裁。格拉古为了打击克拉苏，打算私下放走奴隶大军；克拉苏却重金收买了海盗，并召回在国外作战的两支大军。斯巴达克斯起义军三面受敌，寡不抵众，数万奴隶战死，他与妻子和六千幸存战友均被克拉苏所俘。在最后的关头，由于格拉古的帮助，情况又发生了变化。","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2573968464.jpg","douban_votes":"34869","douban_rating":"8.1","imdb_rating_average":"7.9","imdb_votes":"152732","imdb_rating":"7.9 / 10 from 152,732 users","director":[{"name":"斯坦利·库布里克 Stanley Kubrick","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27260300/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/ef8bf12a8cdcbcc932ca1dcf43465575.jpg"},{"name":"欧文·勒纳 Irving Lerner","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27239092/","role":"","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1618886908.4.webp"},{"name":"亚基马·坎纳特 Yakima Canutt","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27260086/","role":"","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p22311.webp"},{"name":"Marshall Green Marshall Green","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27303153/","role":"","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"Joseph E. Kenney Joseph E. Kenney","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27317047/","role":"","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/